<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mark IV started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mark IV started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Mark IV Industries Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- said expects Mark IV to earn $1.71 a share in fiscal 1998 and $2.00 a share in fiscal 1999.</p>
<p>-- Mark IV gained 1/16 to 24-1/8.</p>
